id: super-ghost-kamikaze-attack
name: Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack
uaType: both
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score 10+
tpCost: 20
type: standard
actionCost: 1
actionCostMax: 3
# "KP Cost: Variable (3(bT) for each Kamikaze Ghost)" - an Action a Ghost; Balloon Flash Bomber's more paid as they are made.
kiCostPerBaseTier: 3
kiPerAction: true
# "For each Action spent, create a Kamikaze Ghost!" - counted on the Item, the Duplicate Minions the table's to make (the
# user's ruling). Its Explode button: the Ghost's Basic Attack out of sequence, Clearing with Small Scale Blast's Minor
# Sphere, Wound Roll + its Life Points, then Defeated (chat.mjs postKamikaze, explodeGhost).
kamikaze: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Kamikaze Ghost for each Action - Duplicate Minions at half their Life Points. Touched, it explodes: a Clearing Basic
  Attack in a Minor Sphere, its Life Points on the Wound Roll, and it is Defeated.
text: >
  Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack: You create a horde of exploding ghostly replicas of yourself to assault your enemies.
  –Ability Type: Magical/Technical
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score 10+
  –TP Cost: 20
  –KP Cost: Variable (3(bT) for each Kamikaze Ghost)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: Variable (1~3 Actions)
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: For each Action spent, create a Kamikaze Ghost! The Kamikaze Ghosts are Duplicate Minions with their Life
  Points reduced by 1/2. If a Character hits a Kamikaze Ghost with an Attacking Maneuver while in their Melee Range, is
  hit by the Physical Attack of a Kamikaze Ghost, or otherwise touches the Kamikaze Ghost in any way (such as either
  attempting to use the Grapple or Thrust Maneuver on the other, and it not failing due to a successful Dodge roll), the
  Kamikaze Ghost uses the Basic Attack Maneuver to use the Clearing Profile (targeting a Square they occupy) with the
  Small Scale Blast Disadvantage as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver (this use of the Clearing Profile may use the Magic
  Modifier as its Damage Attribute). Increase the Wound Roll of this Attacking Maneuver by the amount of Life Points the
  Kamikaze Ghost possesses at that moment. After using this effect, the Kamikaze Ghost is Defeated.
